Package: patternq
Type: Package
Title: Query and Analysis Tools for the Pattern Data Commons
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Benjamin", "Kamphaus", email = "ben@vendekagonlabs.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Pier Federico", "Gherardini", role = "aut",
           comment = "datalogr, wick"),
    person("Lacey", "Kitch", role = "aut", comment = "datalogr, wick"))
Description: Query the Pattern Data Commons (Unify / Datomic) query service with
    Datalog, run canned queries against per-dataset databases, and make plotly
    plots of the results. Consolidates and supersedes datalogr and wick.
